	"interface.interaction.aww_are_you_stuck_here_i_can_take_you_places": "哎呀，你困在这里了吗？我可以带你去别的地方，只要你愿意！",
	"interface.interaction.teleport": "传送",
	"interface.interaction.awww_ty_ty_ty_xoxo": "哇，谢谢，谢谢，谢谢。亲亲抱抱。",
	"interface.interaction.how_kind_of_you_please_accept_this_small_gift_in": "你真好！这份小礼物请收下。",
	"interface.interaction.it_s_that_time_of_the_day_are_you_in": "又到这个时间了！你参加吗？！",
	"interface.interaction.sign_me_up": "给我报名！",
	"interface.interaction.tavern_a_place_for_adventurers_to_relax_drink_unwind_play": "Tavern。冒险者可以在这里休息、喝酒、放松、玩游戏、下注，也可以来场友好较量。目前正在建造中。",
	"interface.interaction.greetings_looking_for_a_good_deal_on_weapons_and_armor": "你好！想买物美价廉的武器和护甲？来对地方了！没人卖的装备比我更好！",
	"interface.interaction.adventurer_i_can_upgrade_your_weapons_or_armors_combine_3": "冒险者！我能强化你的武器和护甲，也能把3件饰品合成一件更强的！不过小心，这个过程并不完美。有时候，物品会……消失。",
	"interface.interaction.upgrade": "强化",
	"interface.interaction.combine": "合成",
	"interface.interaction.lock_prevents_anything_that_can_destroy_an_item_selling_upgrading": "锁定——防止一切可能毁掉物品的操作，出售、强化，诸如此类！封印——锁住物品，解锁要等两天。解锁——让物品恢复自由。懂了？好。费用？250,000金币。",
	"interface.interaction.lock": "锁定",
	"interface.interaction.seal": "封印",
	"interface.interaction.unlock": "解锁",
	"interface.interaction.de_stat_an_item_give_you_back_the_scrolls_used": "移除物品的附加属性，按物品0级时的用量退还属性卷轴。物品和卷轴都会还给你。懂了？好。费用？视卷轴而定，是退还卷轴总价值的10倍。",
	"interface.interaction.de_stat": "移除附加属性",
	"interface.interaction.i_can_craft_or_dismantle_items_for_you_price_differs": "我可以帮你制作或拆解物品，费用因物品而异。有兴趣就看看我的配方！",
