	"interface.interaction.recycling": "回收",
	"interface.interaction.craft": "制作",
	"interface.interaction.dismantle": "拆解",
	"interface.interaction.well_hello_there_i_m_wizard_i_made_this_game": "嗨，你好！我是Wizard，这个游戏是我做的。希望你玩得开心。有问题或建议，欢迎发邮件到hello@adventure.land！",
	"interface.interaction.happy_holidays_please_excuse_my_companion_he_is_a_bit": "节日快乐！请别介意我的伙伴，他有点爱发脾气。如果你找到了Candy Cane，或许能让他开心一点！",
	"interface.interaction.i_have_one": "我有一个！",
	"interface.interaction.anyone_can_become_a_merchant_and_start_trading_you_only": "任何人都能成为商人，开始交易。你只需要一个Merchant Stand来展示物品！",
	"interface.interaction.let_me_buy_one": "我要买一个！",
	"interface.interaction.ah_thanks_for_cheering_him_up_here_s_something_for": "啊！谢谢你让他开心起来。这是给你的谢礼！",
	"interface.interaction.ewww_ewww_ewww_these_wretched_things_ate_my_earrings_kill": "恶心，恶心，恶心！这些可恶的东西吃了我的耳环。杀了它们，一个不留。把我的耳环带回来！",
	"interface.interaction.as_you_wish": "如你所愿",
	"interface.interaction.you_did_well_here_s_something_left_from_one_of": "干得不错。这是我某任前夫留下的东西……",
	"interface.interaction.you_know_it_gets_boring_in_here_sometimes_i_m": "你知道吗，这里有时挺无聊的……我想找点乐子。嗯，你有Mistletoe吗？",
	"interface.interaction.oh_my_i_do": "天哪，我有！",
	"interface.interaction.haha_you_thought_i_was_going_to_give_you_a": "哈哈！你以为我会亲你？！想得美……拿这个吧！",
	"interface.interaction.hmm_we_should_decorate_these_trees_i_need_some_ornaments": "嗯，我们该装饰一下这些树。不过我需要Ornament。如果你收集到了{item}个，告诉我！",
	"interface.interaction.you_got_it": "包在我身上！",
	"interface.interaction.thank_you_here_s_something_in_return": "谢谢！这是回礼。",
	"interface.interaction.bwahahahahah_cough_ehem_thanks_you_got_a_good_deal_keep": "哇哈哈哈哈哈，咳，嗯……谢谢！你赚到了。继续把这些碎片带给我，可别给别人。",
	"interface.interaction.back_in_the_day_we_had_miners_then_came_the": "以前我们有矿工，后来鼹鼠来了。它们免费干活，可取出宝石就麻烦了。带来{item}个Gem Fragment，我就给你点好东西，什么也不问。",
	"interface.interaction.i_got": "我有{item}个！",
	"interface.interaction.hey_hey_hey_what_brings_you_to_this_cold_land": "嘿，嘿，嘿！什么风把你吹到这片寒冷的土地来了？我很喜欢这里，正适合干活。带来{item}个Leather，我就送你一件我的作品。",
	"interface.interaction.i_have": "我有{item}个！",
	"interface.interaction.here_you_go_enjoy_keep_bringing_leathers_to_me_i": "给你，拿好！继续把Leather带来，我还有不少好东西！",
